<title>NETHERLANDS: KUEHNE &amp; HEITZ 1996 NET ALMOST DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>KUEHNE &amp; HEITZ 1996 NET ALMOST DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.38 vs   1.23</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.9  vs   1.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.00 vs   2.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			     443    vs 305</p>
<p>NOTE - Frozen food wholesaler Kuehne &amp; Heitz NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected fabourable market developments in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it could not yet give a 1997 forecast.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
